+    // The only writer of mEvents (CI checks this): keeps mEventTypes, the set of event types the list holds, so
+    // ProcessEventsFor can return at once for a type the script does not have. Elements are never removed and an
+    // element's type never changes once added, so the set stays exact.
+    void AppendEvent(SmartScriptHolder const& e)
